202 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 160 0 R
/E (Security findings from various security scans pile up across projects with no safe way for an AI assistant to query, reason over, or update them. Giving Gemini direct database access means an AI that can read everything can also leak credentials, bypass role boundaries, and leave no trace of what changed. Hence, enterprises need a governed gateway, one that validates every identity, enforces role-based access before any query reaches the database, and writes an immutable record on every status change.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [9]
>>
